{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"杰夫·贝佐斯·影响与遗产","stage":"DONE","category":"jeff-bezos","categoryLabel":"杰夫·贝佐斯","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/09_jeff-bezos/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"影响与遗产\">影响与遗产</h1><p>这一卷要回答一个具体的问题：当我们说杰夫·贝佐斯&quot;改变了世界&quot;，到底改变了什么、有多少能用证据说清、又有多少会真正留下来。它不复述他做过什么——那是生平卷与核心贡献卷的任务——而是把镜头转向&quot;后果&quot;：他下的那些注，在零售业、科技业、商业文化乃至投资界，掀起了怎样可追踪的连锁反应。</p>\n<p>我们刻意避免&quot;深刻影响&quot;&quot;举足轻重&quot;这类无法证伪的赞词。取而代之的是关店清单、破产案卷、市场份额、订阅数据与被反复引用的原文——让影响成为可以核查的东西，而不是一句情绪。</p>\n<p>全卷分三章，按&quot;由近及远&quot;的顺序铺开。第一章&quot;重塑商业&quot;看最直接的冲击波：什么是&quot;亚马逊效应&quot;，它如何拖垮玩具反斗城与西尔斯，又如何溢出零售、改写云计算、物流、订阅与出版。第二章&quot;对商业的影响&quot;上升一层，看他如何把&quot;客户至上&quot;与&quot;长期主义&quot;从口号变成可被模仿的机制，从而扩散进整个商界的方法论。第三章&quot;不朽的遗产&quot;望向更远：作为一个&quot;建造平台&quot;的建造者，他留下了哪些会被后人继续使用的地基与可继承的智慧。</p>\n<p>需要说明边界。本卷只谈正向与中性的影响链条；至于反垄断、劳工条件、财富集中这些影响的另一面，本卷点到为止，完整评价留给&quot;争议与评价&quot;卷。读这一卷，最好先了解他做了什么（核心贡献卷）与他怎么想（思想与方法卷），再来看这些行为如何在世界上激起回响。如果你只想用一句话带走它：贝佐斯的遗产不是某几件产品，而是一套被验证过、并被广泛借用的&quot;如何建造与如何长期思考&quot;的范式。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transforming-commerce","title":"重塑商业","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy/transforming-commerce","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-amazon-effect","title":"亚马逊效应","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy/transforming-commerce/the-amazon-effect"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reshaping-industries","title":"重塑诸多行业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy/transforming-commerce/reshaping-industries"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-on-business","title":"对商业的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-business","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"customer-centricity","title":"客户中心主义的普及","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-business/customer-centricity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"long-term-and-innovation","title":"长期主义与创新文化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-business/long-term-and-innovation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-legacy","title":"不朽的遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-visionary-builder","title":"远见卓识的建造者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/a-visionary-builder"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lasting-wisdom","title":"不朽的智慧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/lasting-wisdom"}]}]}